{"title":"Healing Mushroom Ceremony \"Fully Express Yourself\"","startsAt":"2026-10-24T11:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-24T20:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"**Live Fully Expressed**\n**Group Mushroom Medicine Ceremony**\n\nYou came here to make a mark.\nThat happens by feeling safe to be seen, and expressing the truth within you.\n\nYou are worthy, you deserve to shine, and\nthe time is now!\n\nYou know it's time to share your gifts, and\nthe world is ready to receive them.\n\n**Are you ready to:**\n\n* Love yourself the way you are, and feel confident showing people the real you?\n* Experience less anxiety, more joy, and move through triggers with more ease and grace?\n* Forgive your past self, and move forward feeling empowered by your choices?\n* Be held and guided as you look at negative thought patterns, so you can work through the outdated beliefs associated with them?\n* Free yourself from worry, and self-doubt, and receive practical tools to pull out the roots of heavy emotions?\n* Have a life changing spiritual experience, feel incredible gratitude and appreciation for everything that has brought you to this point, and become the creator of your life moving forward?\n\n**Join Us, Dear Soul.**\nThe time is now to rise up into your most empowered Self. To love, forgive, and feel unconditional self compassion, unlearning the ways you've been taught to judge your emotions, thoughts, and desires.\n\n**When you feel unconditionally loved and supported, you can more easefully bring forward the gifts you came here to share, and the purpose you came here to fulfill.**\n\nThe mind can distract you, and make you question your access to this unconditional love, but when you touch the source of it within you, it clarifies any confusion and you remember that it is your birthright.\n\n**This ceremony is an opportunity to open your heart, and gain control of the mind.**\n**Forgive yourself at the deepest level, and allow gratitude and appreciation to guide you toward freedom.**\n\nWhen you forgive yourself and those around you, your power flows back into you. Gratitude is the open door to freedom and abundance, and **when you recognize the gifts of the lessons life has given you - it becomes easier to let go of anger, resentment, and regret.**\n\nAs you unravel what has been held and blocked within you, there is a natural alchemy that takes place within the body. Energy that became stagnant is unfurled, allowing you to open to your natural confidence, peace, and vitality.\n\n**We create and hold you in a loving space to heal and process through old traumas, ancestral karma, and to become more astutely aware of ego identification, leading to freedom, peace, and simplicity.**\n**Release negative thought patterns, and rewire your nervous system for harmony and balance.**\n\nThis ceremony is a safe space for you to look at the negative thoughts and limiting beliefs that hold you back from feeling your freest, clearest, most fully expressed self. Calm and fortify your system through the awareness of breath, body (all levels - mental, emotional, physical & energetic), your 5 senses, and extrasensory perceptions.\nAs you re-balance and re-align your system you will be able to see your internal experience more clearly, and also recognize why other people are the way they are, allowing you to have more compassion and forgiveness both for others and yourself.\n\n**The more aware you are, the better regulated you are, and from that space you can become the master of your domain. You deserve the space and time to simply be, rest, rejuvenate, and feel the aliveness of living life moment by moment for YOU!**\n**You are fully supported throughout the entire journey.**\n\nThis ceremony includes the optional combination of pure MDMA or 2C-B (additional cost of $20 for 2C-B) along with the psilocybin mushrooms. We have found these medicines work very synergistically together, and offer an amplified level of heart opening. The pure MDMA or 2C-B is optional, and the dosing for both medicines will be based upon your intentions, disposition, prior experience, and current state at the time of the ceremony.\nAfter this ceremony you will feel more love for yourself and others, with a heightened sense of courage, strength, and integrity.\n\n**You will want to make better choices, and also have the self-awareness needed to stay accountable to yourself.**\n\nThis level of love and clarity will emanate out to reach and impact all those closest to you.\nThis ceremony will support you to nurture and strengthen the new pathways you are choosing to take mentally, physically and spiritually, to ensure you are a living a life that feels in rhythm with your body and soul. Receive the support you need to let go of the pain, hurt, sense of unworthiness & not enoughness, as well as the struggle we can all feel victim to at times.\n\n**We invite you to open up your heart, and love and forgive yourself through unconditional acceptance. To awaken to your divinity and beauty, and access your greatest gifts of self-healing and conscious creatorship.**\n\n**Ceremony Preparation & Integration**\n\nPrior to the ceremony you will receive an in-depth **plant medicine workbook** to help you prepare, questions to ask yourself and a recommended diet to support your experience.\nWe will meet as a group before the ceremony for an **Intention Setting Call**, to connect with each other and share our intentions for the journey. You will also receive a **nervous system regulating practice** that supports in expanding internal awareness, grounding, centering and overall mindfulness.\nFollowing the Ceremony we will have an **Integration Call** to support and hold space for continued breakthroughs, challenges and dream weaving.\n\n(*All is Included in the Energy Exchange)*\n\n**Ceremony Day Flow**\n\n* Introduction & Sharing of Intentions\n* Opening the Directions\n* Mushroom Medicine Ceremony:\n\n**What Can Happen Throughout**\n**This Sacred Ceremony**\n\n* Calling in Deities to Support Moving Through Energy Blockages & Embodiment of your Highest Virtues.\n* Shamanic Drumming for Answering Prayers, Deep Emotional Healing, Connecting to Ancestors & True Forgiveness.\n* Medicine Songs, Frequency Transmissions, Gong, Shruti, Theta Chimes, Animal Spirit Drumming, Crystal Harp, Singing Bowls, etc.\n* Periods of Pure Silence\n* Earth Core Connection & Synchronizing with Mother Nature's Clock.\n* Channelling of Higher Dimensional Wisdom\n* Inter Dimensional Shifts of Consciousness\n* Future Visioning into Your Becoming\n* Energetic Shedding of the Old Self & Re-birthing as Who You Truly Are.\n\n**Ceremony Closing**\n\n* Integrative Sound Journey\n* Gratitude Circle & Honouring of Spiritual Supports\n\n**Timing**\nSaturday, October 24th, 2026:\n11 AM - 8:00 PM\n\n**Location**\nToronto, Ontario (Leslieville)\nExact Address Given Upon RSVP\n\n**Energy Exchange**\n$325+tax ($367.25) = *when paid by Sept 29th*\n$375+tax ($423.75) = *Sept 30th or after*\n\n(Includes Group Intention Setting Call, Ceremony,\nPost Ceremony Integration Call, & Prep Material)\n\nSend $84.75 ($75+tax) deposit or full amount to:\n**E-Transfer:** [chris@chrisdubkundalini.com](mailto:chris@chrisdubkundalini.com)\n**Paypal:** [chrisdubkundalini@gmail.com](mailto:chrisdubkundalini@gmail.com)\n\\*\\*Credit Card: [HERE ](https://www.paypal.com/paypalme/chrisdubkundalini?locale.x=en_US)\\*\\*through paypal\n\n*\\*Email [soulguided@soulguidednetwork.com](mailto:soulguided@soulguidednetwork.com) if you are interested in joining the ceremony so you can fill out the intake form & get on a connection call to see if this is a fit. If you have worked with either of us before or we know each other well, you can just send the deposit.*\n\n***A couple spots are reserved for financial assistance. If you are in need, reach out to us at: [[soulguided@soulguidednetwork.com](mailto:soulguided@soulguidednetwork.com)] to start the conversation.***\n\n**Micro Dosing & Commonly Experienced Breakthroughs With Psilocybin Mushrooms**\nHello Evolving Souls, thanks for taking the time to read this newsletter. Moving forward I will be sharing the incredible benefits & breakthroughs that happen working intentionally with mushrooms… along with knowledge of effective spiritual practices & other psychedelic medicines to support your evolution.\n\n**7 Incredible Benefits of Working with Psilocybin**\n\n* Helps to identify Addictive patterns & to work through\nbelief systems and trauma associated with them\n* Assists in alleviating OCD\n* Relieves Anxiety\n* Stimulates Brain Cells\n* Life Changing Spiritual Experiences\n* Restructures Neural Networks\n\n**Interested in Minimum Effective Dose Mushroom Micro-Dosing?**\n\nWe have perfected Psilocybin Micro Dose Capsules mixed with Lions Mane with a dose that is subtle and be can taken even on work days. Perfect if you are looking for a long term commitment to micro dosing with no unexpected side effects. We have had many people, including ourselves that have effectively micro dosed to get more in touch with their feelings, increase creativity and work flow productivity and efficiency. We have already helped some brave souls ween off Anti-Depressants & Anti-Anxiety meds through consistent micro-dosing.\n\n. \\*\\*Please note that this should NOT be used as medical advice and you should always consult your medical healthcare professional before adjusting any prescriptions.\n\n**Psilocybin Mushroom & Lions Mane**\n**Micro-Dose Pricing**\n*Ingredients: Each capsule contains .05g of Golden Teacher Psilocybin Mushrooms*\n*& 300 mg of Organic Lions Mane Mushrooms*\n\n60 capsules = $95 ($107.35 w/ tax) ($1.58 per capsule)\n120 capsules = $155 ($175.15 w/ tax) ($1.29 per capsule)\n180 capsules = $210 ($237.30 w/ tax) ($1.16 per capsule)\n\nYour purchase includes a micro-dosing guide that will support you in working with this medicine in an effective way.\n*Please e-transfer to [chris@chrisdubkundalini.com](mailto:chris@chrisdubkundalini.com) to pay for your order or to if you need any extra info, we can also set-up a call so I can help answer any questions.*\n\\*\\*\\*\n**About Your Facilitators**\n\n**Chris Dub**\n***Intuitive Healer, Tantric Kundalini Yogi, Quan Yin Energy Healer, Transformational Teacher & Ceremony Facilitator***\n\nChris is devoted to cultivating and holding space for you to become more aware of your mental blocks and repressed emotions, which allows this energy to transform into a higher understanding of one’s self and your interconnectedness to all of nature. The result is a high degree of self love which leads to a letting go of past pain, hurt and trauma. Experience increased energy flow and creativity, zest for life, calmed nervous system, amplified self worth and deeper, more meaningful relationships.\n\nChris is a Certified Kundalini Yoga Teacher, Yoga Alliance Certified, Quan Yin Energy Healer & holds a Degree in Social Work. He teaches Kundalini Yoga, Meditation, Self-Awareness Practices, Sound-Healing and Breath-Work classes and events. Chris facilitates transformational retreats and deep healing ceremonies, he also hosts the Sacred Brotherhood Men’s Group and Women’s & Men’s Love Circles. Chris has undergone intensive breath work, bodily cleansing, meditation and self-inquiry to move through chronic pain and find deeper depths of self love since 2009.\n\nChris is passionate about supporting you to bring self awareness and energy flow practices to your daily life so you’re internal GPS can always be online, guiding you to the most heart nourishing and fulfilling experiences.\n\n[Check out more of Chris Dub's offerings here](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1_aIUQ2GpMysre--2kmY1ILu9TmpbDVjfOx-v7xw0IL8/edit?tab=t.0)\n\n**Jennifer Mya**\n***Certified Nutritional Practitioner, Multidimensional Healer, Ceremony & Retreat Facilitator, Womb Wisdom, Medicine Woman.***\n\nJennifer is a guide for you to come home to who you truly are. A multi-modality, multidimensional healer and facilitator of tantric and shamanic arts, rose codes, somatic practice, and direct transmission, Jennifer helps you uncover and heal the root cause of repetitive patterns and limiting beliefs that hold you back from living your best life.\n\nAfter working together you will feel more confident to use your authentic voice, experience a sense of worthiness and enoughness through your everyday, and cultivate lasting self-love and self-acceptance of who you are, exactly as you are.\nJennifer offers 1:1 mentorship, and a 13-week comprehensive journey to breakthrough limiting beliefs and come home to your divine self, called Wild Feminine Freedom.\n\n[Click here to see more of Jennifer's offerings](https://www.jenniferpolansky.ca/)","venue":{"name":"Leslieville","address":"Leslieville, Toronto, ON, Canada, Toronto","lat":43.666565,"lng":-79.339645,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Plant Spirit Medicine Ceremonies","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/d/b/7/4/highres_536096180.jpeg"}